E=/home/user/Nicole-projects/elevenlabs/el.py
ST="Stylized 3D cartoon animation like a family animated feature film, vertical 9:16, smooth expressive character animation, consistent characters exactly as in the first frame. The macaw keeps the same beige bucket hat with its patch facing forward. Simple calm camera, one continuous shot, no cuts, no text on screen. Only the character who is speaking moves its mouth; everyone else keeps the mouth closed while listening. Dialogue in Spanish with a Honduran accent."
NEG="realistic, photorealistic, text, letters, subtitles, captions, watermark, distorted face, extra limbs, wrong character speaking, lip movement on listeners, morphing objects, camera cuts, flicker"
v(){ o=$1; d=$2; p=$3; [ -s vid/$o.mp4 ] && return; python3 $E video "$ST $p" -o vid/$o.mp4 --ar 9:16 --dur $d --res 4K --start sf/$o.png --neg "$NEG" > vid/$o.log 2>&1; }
mkdir -p vid
c1(){
v 01 6 "The macaw flies down and lands on the painted wall with the bag of clothes, shakes its feathers and says excitedly, beak moving: \"¡Ya traje la ropa pa'l Año Viejo!\" Kids with sparklers run in the background. Ambient: neighborhood evening, distant sparklers." &
v 02 8 "The old man with the mustache keeps stuffing sawdust into the rag doll, then looks at the camera proudly and says, lips moving: \"Este año lo vamos a hacer bien grandote... que se lleve todo lo malo.\" He pats the doll's shoulder. Ambient: evening street." &
v 03 6 "The woman with hair rollers tucks the paper bill into the doll's pocket and says with a mischievous grin, lips moving: \"¡Aquí van los apagones!\" The old man listens, mouth closed. Then suddenly ALL the lights of the street go out for one second (darkness), and come back on; everyone bursts out laughing. Ambient: power buzz, laughter." &
v 04 6 "First, the boy on the left pushes the scribbled notebook into the doll and shouts happily, lips moving: \"¡Las tareas de matemática!\" The man on the right listens with mouth closed. Then the chubby man on the right puts the toy taxi into the doll and says, lips moving: \"¡Y el tráfico del bulevar!\" while the boy laughs with mouth closed. Ambient: laughter." &
wait; }
c2(){
v 05 6 "The macaw on the chair arm opens an empty wallet; a little moth flies out of it. The macaw looks at the camera and says with playful relief, beak moving: \"Y esto... ¡el andar hule!\" and stuffs the wallet into the doll. Neighbors in the background laugh. Ambient: laughter." &
v 06 6 "The woman runs down the street pulling the rolling suitcase. The macaw flying above her asks curiously, beak moving: \"¿Y para dónde va, doña Tencha?\" while she keeps her mouth closed. Then she answers laughing while running, lips moving: \"¡Pa' que este año sí viaje, mijo!\" and the macaw listens with its beak closed. Ambient: suitcase wheels on pavement." &
v 07 6 "The tiny grandmother sweeps the dust out of her door with energy and says firmly, lips moving: \"¡Fuera lo malo, que entre lo bueno!\" The macaw sitting on the clothesline above with the yellow clothes covers its eyes with a wing, amused, beak closed. Ambient: broom sweeping." &
v 08 8 "The old man hands bags of grapes to the kids and, wagging his finger kindly, says, lips moving: \"Y con cuidado con la pólvora, ¿oyeron, cipotes?\" The kids answer together happily: \"¡Sí, don Chepe!\" The macaw on his shoulder nods, beak closed. Ambient: neighborhood night." &
wait; }
c3(){
v 09 8 "Just before midnight, all the neighbors count down together loudly in Spanish: \"¡Diez, nueve, ocho, siete, seis, cinco, cuatro, tres, dos, uno!\" while the macaw in front stuffs grapes into its beak one after another, cheeks getting bigger and bigger. At the end everyone shouts \"¡Feliz año!\" and the macaw tries to say it with its mouth full, making a funny muffled sound. Ambient: excitement." &
v 10 8 "Midnight. The rag doll effigy burns in a warm cheerful bonfire, sparks rising; the neighbors at a safe distance clap and cheer; colorful fireworks burst in the sky; the macaw flies happily in circles above the crowd. No dialogue. Sound: fireworks, crackling fire, cheering." &
v 11 8 "The old man hugs the macaw warmly, then looks at it with wet happy eyes and says, lips moving: \"Feliz año, guarita. Gracias por estar con nosotros.\" The macaw listens with its beak closed, moved, then answers happily, beak moving: \"¡Feliz año, don Chepe!\" and hugs him again. Fireworks glow. Ambient: distant fireworks." &
v 12 8 "On the rooftop, the macaw looks at the fireworks over the city, eats the last grape, closes its eyes and makes a wish, saying softly, beak moving: \"Que este año conozcamos más de nuestra tierra... y que nadie ande hule.\" Then it opens its eyes and smiles at the camera. Fireworks keep blooming. Ambient: distant fireworks." &
wait; }
